{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_st01","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_st01","title":"晚風輕拂","storyCode":"CB-ST1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_st01.txt","sourceHash":"204b2a351f0d33e81ef119608d583af423dcd87c4c31b0c1383bb2e798865403","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"卡彭背叛了甘比諾。莫斯提馬救下了拜松。鼠王露出了真面目。龍門晚風輕拂。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n......以前的日子裡，我一直以為我是個出色的信使。\n信使，運送貨物、信件。\n也許是思念，也許是財富，也有時候，會帶去毀滅。\n父親是個厲害的人物，從米諾斯到龍門，他建立了峯馳物流。\n利益，諂媚，黨同伐異。\n這些東西很複雜，也很麻煩，但我勉強能應付。\n但父親告訴過我......\n大地的彼端會更精彩一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔！我這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你在嘟囔什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"醒了的話，就安靜點，否則有你好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，等首領解決了企鵝物流，會來處理你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（我......被這些傢伙......德克薩斯他們還在和黑手黨交戰嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（該死......為什麼我一點用場都派不上......我可是峯馳物流的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（......車停了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是我們，首領把那個豐蹄小子抓住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你要做什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是卡彭先生的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭？這可是首領的命令！他膽敢僭越——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我膽敢什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，峯馳物流的小少爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們第一次正式見面，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......你射殺了自己的同伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"懲罰叛徒可沒有違背龍門的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是指這個......你想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"做一筆交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"顯而易見，甘比諾的匹夫之勇會讓家族溺斃在所謂的榮光裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不想，相當一部分人並不想，做無意義的陪葬，誰會想呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我會幫助你對付甘比諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也能幫助你對付企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是傻子。在龍門待了很多年，我早就在做各種準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父親大權在握，佔據龍門七成以上的民事信使工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，和龍門高層有一些戰略合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"無論怎麼看，企鵝物流都是你們事業上最大的障礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的目標只是接手企鵝物流的全部管道。欠下這個人情，咱們之間的生意可以再議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"父親和大帝先生相交莫逆，很遺憾，你的猜測不過是自以為是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"峯馳物流這樣的龐然大物，真的只是你父親說了算嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎有點小看我們，也許如今的家族已經在多次偶然的失敗中損耗殆盡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"但很久以前，我們的祖輩可是曾在敘拉古那些漆黑的議事桌上，驕傲的自稱“西西里人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"權利不斷輪換，血肉模糊，而我耳濡目染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"實話實說吧，你父親身邊的那些人對企鵝物流是怎麼想的？對龍門是怎麼想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是怎麼想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......你口口聲聲在強調家族，剛才卻親手殺了自己的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我會接受你的提議嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"他的死只是單純的......利益交換。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，天知道你們支付的會是鈔票還是炸藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——很遺憾，我本以為你會更加成熟一點。你卻要為了一個與你無關的小小紕漏而喪命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你害怕了。就算身為峯馳物流的部門經理，你也只是個乳臭未乾的臭小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......不好意思，米諾斯的年輕人，向來都是以大膽出名的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你還是不打算改變主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能活下去的話，你會見到更多這種事，可惜現在，你只有死路一條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘖——！這繩子怎麼這麼牢，來不及了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕你死了，峯馳物流按捺不住，說不定還會牽扯出龍門近衛局，局勢會變得更加混亂，對我來說，也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"交談很短暫，說再見吧，小少爺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，可你對拜松出手的話，就不屬於懲罰叛徒的範疇了喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還是說你覺得在這裡就結束，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"誰！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"路過的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......我對你有印象，長角的薩科塔，今晚你給我們添了不少麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"非常榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒有在企鵝物流的任何情報中聽說過你，你到底是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我有必要回答你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來找我丟失的包裹的，嗯，就像普通的信使那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭先生，我們已經控制了這個據點。這裡都是支持您的人，她孤立無援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？還是要動手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是沒關係，隨時奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......普通的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，箭在弦上，我們各自都有要做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"想送死你自己去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是為了活下去才做這一切的，不要本末倒置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......別說得那麼嚇人，我真的只是一個普通的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"長角的薩科塔人說自己普通，誰會相信呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我無意和你戰鬥，請便吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才還要殺人滅口，轉眼就願意放人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"黑手黨的生活就是這樣，充滿了太多我不喜歡的意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，既然小少爺不願意合作，又很難去死，那我只好去找找別的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"有機會的話，今天晚些時候見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"但願那個時候，你們已經被甘比諾解決掉了，或者，反過來也行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......他真的走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經給自己鬆綁了吧？要搭把手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我自己能起來。謝謝幫忙，莫斯提馬小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，從你臉上的表情看來，被折騰的不輕吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們的，節奏有點太快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我提醒過你，那麼，他們人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯說要去“大地的盡頭”。一個小時後在那裡集合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，我來給你帶路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那大地的盡頭......這個名字，到底意味著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這個名字的由來已經不可考了，現在算是老闆的私人財產，也是據點之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"來自各地的人士趨之若鶩，至少在地下勢力之間很有名吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那究竟是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"其實就是一家酒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬小姐，我們這是在做什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在桌布裡偽裝成一個大號幽靈，這可是最便利的化妝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我問的是，我們為什麼要偽裝成一個大號幽靈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"符合安魂夜的氣氛嘛，其他人只會覺得我們是在搞什麼活動喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那位“卡彭先生”可沒有走太遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"突然出現一個長著黑角的薩科塔人，還拿著法杖，氣勢洶洶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"像他那種總覺得一切要盡在掌握的傢伙，總會小心翼翼的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"法杖......我才注意到，原來莫斯提馬小姐是源石技藝的使用者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前的事情了，真要說，我也是接受過系統訓練的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"和天天睡覺偷懶的能天使完全不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬小姐果然和能天使小姐是舊識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，原本，我們應該在吵鬧的迎新派對上暢所欲言才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不過偶爾發生點爆炸和襲擊也是應該的。畢竟是企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"應該的嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"意外嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想莫斯提馬小姐這樣的信使也會有這樣的時候......畢竟有著那麼多謎一樣的傳言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"失望了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不！沒有！我這麼說是不是有點太失禮了，抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我也是企鵝物流的一員，信使出沒在這片大地的各個角落，“隨機應變”可是員工須知的第一條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"第一條的版本越來越多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我回憶一下，這裡，往左，再往右，然後在第三個巷口拐彎......嗯，我們抄一條近路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"時間已經這麼晚了，但街上的人卻越來越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是安魂夜的魅力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"很有意思吧？外面有花車店鋪和安魂夜派對，而這裡只有難聞的下水道蒸氣，只不過一牆之隔而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......很有意思，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"時間很緊，我們得加快腳步了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cenmetery"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是，墓地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，會把墓地建在市中心的城市也只有龍門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些人，都穿著喪服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"肅穆的哀悼，讓人想起在拉特蘭的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭......那是一個什麼樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你很好奇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。我其實一直想去更遠的地方看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"但我什麼時候才有機會攬到國際信使合約呢......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"城際網路比過去發達多了，總會有離開城市的機會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且，越遙遠的距離，承載的意義也就越重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"穿越國家與國家之間的旅程，很艱辛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......真要說的話，最大的問題是天災吧。如果不小心撞上了，那你面對的敵人會是整個泰拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"以前因為在中轉站的時候遺落了天災信使的報告，所以遇上了那麼一次，雖然離著好幾座山頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"烏雲密佈而下墜，暴虐的天空與你為敵，這種感覺很不好，相當不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"天災......如果是移動城市的話，應該不會被直擊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"也有很多別的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"城市為了躲避天災而移動城區，原本近在眼前的目的地就那麼漸行漸遠，你想像一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那還真是糟糕，太糟糕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"所以一定要和天災信使的同僚們打好關係。以及，一定不要在他們定期聯絡的時候打瞌睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘿嘿，這麼一聊，莫斯提馬小姐才更像個同行嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對不起，是我有些鬆懈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——莫斯提馬小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？啊，抱歉，想起了點事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要穿過墓地，腳步放輕點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_4_back"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_4_fro"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道安魂夜的由來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼突然提起這個？我記得，似乎和薩卡茲們的古老祭祀有關係......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安魂夜其實來源於古代薩卡茲們的某種祭祀活動，很久以前，這個名字的意義要更加複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大部分節日都和祭祀啊，崇拜啊有關吧。只是人們在不斷忘卻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人們迎回逝者的靈魂，在安魂夜撫平他們留存人間的執念，轉入輪迴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在很少有人把這些東西當真了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生者們歌舞昇平地扮演幽靈，真正的亡者卻在墓地裡無人問津，這可不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許有時候，經歷的事情太多，就會想要靠遺忘來安撫自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們都經歷了很多事情。畢竟這世上最不缺的就是災難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是看著那些獻花的掃墓人，心情總歸會平靜一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cenmetery"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，莫斯提馬小姐，你剛才似乎說過要搶回自己的包裹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒說過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"有人付了一大筆錢委託我，委託內容是“帶拜松見見世面”，嗯，很有風格的委託吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"老、老爹......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你的考察成績如何，其實也看我的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老爺爺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼晚，都沒人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃百家飯長大的孩子，真是說不見就不見，什麼礦石病，是你自己想太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"董阿伯過得很好，生意一直不差。這兩天還帶了個小學徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於你嘛，就是不讓人省心，不肯好好做生意，要去混......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老爺爺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老婆子，你少說點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都像你一樣沒良心？快點蠟燭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老爺爺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我火呢......哦，這兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老爺爺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這臭小子學抽煙那時，人也不見了。現在突然想起來，從來沒給他遞過火，遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老爺爺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蠟燭多不帶勁，我給你點支煙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"臭老頭，你真點煙？沒大沒小的，快換蠟燭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老爺爺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，點上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿發......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老爺爺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行了，安魂夜不許哭喪，走吧，時候不早了，回家讓董小子給咱們炒個腸粉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大半夜的吃什麼腸粉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......年輕人，謝謝你帶我們來這裡，晚上看不清路，幫了大忙了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒關係，順路罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，起風了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"有點涼意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"清爽的夜風，還有股糖果的甜味，以及燈火輝煌的城市夜景，這才是龍門一絕呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"看見那片黃金色的浮誇街道了嗎？像午夜的太陽一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那就是目的地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"日落大道東1301號，門口有巨大的企鵝塗鴉，很好認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的路，你得自己走過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝塗鴉......我明白了，但是莫斯提馬小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——我總不能一直護在你身邊吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒是沒錯......但莫斯提馬小姐上次也是這樣突然消失......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啦，怎麼說我也有其他的工作在身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"要和大家好好相處喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我盡力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，回頭見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......董阿伯，發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿孑？你沒事就好，快回家裡去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？碼頭的人？還是那些學生混混？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，都不是，這次你就別管了，人沒大礙就行，吃點小虧，多大的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"阿伯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......老頭老太今天去給阿發那小子掃墓，你不認識，算是他們半個孫子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看老人家回來得晚，就想做點菜送過去，然後就遇到那些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"誰動的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......反正不是龍門人，你就別摻和了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿孑！你好不容易才解除了和鬼姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和星熊警官的誤會，不是給你介紹了工作嗎？好好珍惜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，阿伯就先好好休息吧"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿孑，臭小子，你回來，你去哪兒？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唉！怎麼就是不肯聽話！這臭小子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"後生們有所為有所不為，你心裡早該樂開花了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......林？你來幹嘛？看我出糗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"作為龍門最好的魚丸師傅，你不應該冒這個險，告訴他們又何妨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王在哪裡有那麼重要嗎？要是大家吃不到最好的魚丸，該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"規矩就是規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這破規矩都是我們定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那也是規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你白挨了一頓打。我沒打算一直躲躲藏藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呸，天知道你打的什麼算盤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我扶你起來。當了這多年魚丸師傅，身手退步了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真動了手，回頭又要被人盯上，你幫我擺平？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只想安安靜靜過日子，挨頓打就挨頓打吧，又沒少挨過打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，看到老夥計們都這麼有精神，我也放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你才是他們的目標，你放心個屁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣才放心啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你總是這樣，不累嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"累得很，但畢竟不是過去了，我們都有各自的責任，我們肩負著一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"賣你的魚丸，別的不關你事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"走得動嗎？陪我遛個彎如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，這才多大事——痛痛痛！你幹嘛！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"皮肉傷也是傷，老樣子，死逞強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要再想過去的事情了，這是你選擇的生活，沒必要愧疚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你的魚丸也是龍門的一部分，比我更重要的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經自由了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我怎麼不見你來照顧我的生意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——換個話題吧，你最近過得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其實我聽說哥倫比亞盛行龍門料理，我打算找機會去那兒發展發展——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提馬"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
